+# Chapter 2 art integration — 2026-10-26
+
+Original uploaded PNGs are copied without modifying artwork or alpha.
+
+| Asset | Source | Usage |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| images/chapter2/characters/ch2_farmer_worried.png | 心配顔の麦わら帽子農夫.png | Scenes 4, 21 |
+| images/chapter2/characters/ch2_manager_serious.png | 真剣な表情のフィールド技師キャラクター.png | Scenes 6, 12, 13, 21, 22 |
+| images/chapter2/events/ch2_saya_toyoyo_escape.png | 駆け抜ける少女とふわもこ獣.png | Scene 2, lines 1–4; no duplicate portraits |
+
+Scene 21 uses dry_canal through line 4 and restored_canal from farmer line 5.
+Morii uses existing normal/smile/serious/surprised portraits; scene presence unchanged.
+Large enemies use increased arena width/height without enlarging the question layout.
+
+Child-stage boss HP / defense / attack (all scale with evolution as before):
+- Chapter 1 guardian: 200 / 22 / 18 (was 140 / 16 / 14)
+- Chapter 1 black mist: 140 / 20 / 13 (was 90 / 16 / 10)
+- Chapter 2 gate guardian: 210 / 32 / 8 (was 165 / 28 / 6)
+- Chapter 2 resonance beast: 320 / 36 / 10 (was 220 / 28 / 6)
+
+Existing ongoing combat snapshots are not migrated. New stats apply at battle start/retry.
